# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:13
translate italian jamietv2_fd039b16:

    # "I walk up to Jamie's door and knock."
    "mi avvicino alla porta di Jamie e busso."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:14
translate italian jamietv2_fdad75c4:

    # "I wait a bit for her to answer and after a few moments, I almost walk away thinking that she isn't home or is busy or something."
    "Aspetto un po’ che mi risponda e, dopo qualche istante, sto quasi per andarmene pensando che non sia in casa o che sia occupata o qualcosa del genere."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:19
translate italian jamietv2_56b288a0:

    # "Then, just when I am about to leave, she opens the door."
    "Poi, proprio mentre sto per andarmene, lei apre la porta."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:20
translate italian jamietv2_348b659c:

    # gnd "Hey sorry, I must have fell asleep on the couch."
    gnd "Ehi, scusa, devo essermi addormentata sul divano."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:21
translate italian jamietv2_85e15039:

    # pc "Oh I'm sorry, I didn't mean to wake you. Was just wondering if you wanted to hang out?"
    pc "Oh, scusa, non volevo svegliarti. Mi stavo solo chiedendo se ti andava di uscire un po’?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:22
translate italian jamietv2_8cddc873:

    # gnd "Sure, want to come watch TV with me?"
    gnd "Certo, ti va di venire a guardare la TV con me?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:23
translate italian jamietv2_6eafa1e5:

    # pc "Are you sure? You look pretty tired."
    pc "Sei sicura? Sembri piuttosto stanca."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:24
translate italian jamietv2_d5f53ad3:

    # gnd "I'm exhausted, but I'd still like to spend some time with you."
    gnd "Sono esausta, ma mi piacerebbe comunque passare un po’ di tempo con te."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:25
translate italian jamietv2_35743d5e:

    # pc "Okay then."
    pc "Va bene allora."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:26
translate italian jamietv2_d6443097:

    # "We walk inside and sit down on her couch to watch TV together."
    "Entriamo e ci sediamo sul suo divano per guardare la TV insieme."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:29
translate italian jamietv2_4eefcd41:

    # pc "You not been sleeping well?"
    pc "Non dormi bene?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:30
translate italian jamietv2_d3a1e5f8:

    # gnd "I've just been studying a lot. It's been tough."
    gnd "È solo che sto studiando molto. È stata dura."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:31
translate italian jamietv2_6d7e76b4:

    # pc "Tell me about it."
    pc "Non me lo dire."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:32
translate italian jamietv2_56872787:

    # gnd "But I'm glad to spend some time with you, even if I'm sleepy."
    gnd "Ma sono contenta di passare un po’ di tempo con te, anche se ho sonno."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:37
translate italian jamietv2_c7a75159:

    # gnd "Are you implying I'm not cute when I'm not sleepy?"
    gnd "Stai insinuando che non sono carina quando non ho sonno?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:38
translate italian jamietv2_4db958a5:

    # pc "What? No."
    pc "Cosa? No."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:39
translate italian jamietv2_cf0825c6:

    # gnd "I'm just kidding. Thanks, you're sweet."
    gnd "Sto solo scherzando. Grazie, sei dolce."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:42
translate italian jamietv2_175d3768:

    # gnd "What? Are you serious?"
    gnd "Cosa? Dici sul serio?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:43
translate italian jamietv2_61f77a4c:

    # pc "Sure."
    pc "Certo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:44
translate italian jamietv2_f3a7bdd3:

    # gnd "That's probably not a good idea. My dad might actually kill you."
    gnd "Probabilmente non è una buona idea. Mio padre potrebbe davvero ucciderti."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:45
translate italian jamietv2_796397b3:

    # pc "It might be worth the risk."
    pc "Potrebbe valere la pena rischiare."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:46
translate italian jamietv2_34f266ea:

    # gnd "You're crazy!"
    gnd "Sei pazza!"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:49
translate italian jamietv2_d13864ee:

    # gnd "But no, let's just watch TV."
    gnd "Ma no, guardiamo semplicemente la TV."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:52
translate italian jamietv2_8105064d:

    # "She smiles at me and we both turn towards the TV and watch the show."
    "Mi sorride e ci giriamo entrambi verso la TV per guardare il programma."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:55
translate italian jamietv2_e4b4fe92:

    # "After the first commercial break, I hear her snoring softly and a moment later, she leans over and lays her head on my shoulder."
    "Dopo la prima pausa pubblicitaria, la sento russare dolcemente e un attimo dopo si sporge e appoggia la testa sulla mia spalla."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:56
translate italian jamietv2_72d126bc:

    # "I sit there like that, feeling her warm weight against me, smelling the scent of her shampoo. It's nice."
    "Me ne sto lì seduto così, sentendo il suo peso caldo contro di me, respirando il profumo del suo shampoo. È bello."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:57
translate italian jamietv2_a7276863:

    # "I watch the rest of the show, letting her sleep on my shoulder until the credits roll."
    "Guardo il resto del programma, lasciandola dormire sulla mia spalla fino ai titoli di coda."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:60
translate italian jamietv2_aced7ae5:

    # "The music playing during the credits wakes her and she opens her eyes and looks up at me, putting her hand on my chest."
    "La musica che suona durante i titoli di coda la sveglia e lei apre gli occhi e mi guarda, mettendomi una mano sul petto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:61
translate italian jamietv2_222fe902:

    # gnd "Oh man, I missed the whole thing."
    gnd "Oh cavolo, mi sono perso tutto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:62
translate italian jamietv2_7289beae:

    # pc "Yeah, I'll have to fill you in later."
    pc "Sì, dovrò raccontarti tutto più tardi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:63
translate italian jamietv2_d912edc5:

    # gnd "You could have woke me up."
    gnd "Avresti potuto svegliarmi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:66
translate italian jamietv2_fd8175bb:

    # gnd "I definitely did."
    gnd "L’ho fatto eccome."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:68
translate italian jamietv2_7b910158:

    # gnd "You're so silly."
    gnd "Sei proprio uno sciocco."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:69
translate italian jamietv2_d404c590:

    # gnd "Do you really think I'm cute?"
    gnd "Pensi davvero che io sia carina?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:70
translate italian jamietv2_2951ed74:

    # pc "Definitely."
    pc "Assolutamente sì."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:71
translate italian jamietv2_d2d7ae9c:

    # gnd "I think you're cute too."
    gnd "Anch’io penso che tu sia carino."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:72
translate italian jamietv2_e8e9a7f7:

    # "Once again, her dad picks the worst moment to open the door and walk in."
    "Ancora una volta, suo padre sceglie il momento peggiore per aprire la porta ed entrare."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:73
translate italian jamietv2_9da07a83:

    # "Jamie leans away from me and stands up."
    "Jamie si allontana da me e si alza in piedi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:79
translate italian jamietv2_d41d8cd9:

    # voice "voices/jamie_011.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_011.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:80
translate italian jamietv2_25b98dfa:

    # gnd "Hey, Daddy."
    gnd "Ehi, papà."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:81
translate italian jamietv2_20dcad47:

    # jd "Send him home."
    jd "Mandalo a casa."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:82
translate italian jamietv2_f2596c67:

    # "Her dad doesn't say anything else and instead walks past us and into the kitchen."
    "Suo padre non dice nient’altro e invece ci supera ed entra in cucina."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:86
translate italian jamietv2_84d4365c:

    # gnd "He must have had a bad day."
    gnd "Deve aver avuto una brutta giornata."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:87
translate italian jamietv2_b44cf649:

    # pc "I should probably go."
    pc "Probabilmente dovrei andarmene."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:88
translate italian jamietv2_a6870bf2:

    # gnd "Yeah, I'm sorry."
    gnd "Sì, mi dispiace."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:89
translate italian jamietv2_b219d344:

    # pc "It's okay."
    pc "Va bene."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:92
translate italian jamietv2_36b8ae4f:

    # gnd "Thanks for coming over tonight. I had a good time."
    gnd "Grazie per essere venuta stasera. Mi sono divertito."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:93
translate italian jamietv2_041dfd87:

    # pc "More like you had a good nap."
    pc "Anzi, ti sei fatta un bel pisolino."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:94
translate italian jamietv2_b762e00f:

    # gnd "That too. Your shoulder is very comfy."
    gnd "Anche quello. La tua spalla è molto comoda."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:98
translate italian jamietv2_4bbcc4b9:

    # gnd "I might take you up on that."
    gnd "Potrei approfittarne."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:100
translate italian jamietv2_f9097bdf:

    # gnd "I'm sure they'll show re-runs all week."
    gnd "Sono sicuro che trasmetteranno le repliche per tutta la settimana."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:101
translate italian jamietv2_dfc3c586:

    # pc "Alright, well I better head home."
    pc "Va bene, beh, è meglio che torni a casa."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:103
translate italian jamietv2_ecb1e778:

    # gnd "Okay, [pcname]. See you again soon."
    gnd "Ok, [pcname]. Ci vediamo presto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:104
translate italian jamietv2_209b1712:

    # pc "See ya."
    pc "Ci vediamo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieTV/jamietv2.rpy:105
translate italian jamietv2_1557defd:

    # "With that, she goes back inside and I walk back over to my house."
    "Detto questo, lei torna in casa e io mi incammino verso casa mia."

